{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/react/04_Array_Object_State_변경하기/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"복사-수정-적용\" style=\"position:relative;\">복사, 수정, 적용<a href=\"#%EB%B3%B5%EC%82%AC-%EC%88%98%EC%A0%95-%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"복사 수정 적용 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>array나 Object로 된 state를 변경할 때는<br>\n기존 state를 copy하여 수정 한 후 setState 해줘야 한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setTitle<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'남자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'강남 우동맛집'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'리액트 독학'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> copy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">...</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  copy<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'여자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">setTitle</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>copy<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>글 수정<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"setstate변경할-값-함수의-동작-특징\" style=\"position:relative;\">setState(변경할 값) 함수의 동작 특징<a href=\"#setstate%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%A0-%EA%B0%92-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%EC%9D%98-%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"setstate변경할 값 함수의 동작 특징 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>기존 state와 변경될 state를 비교 후 다를때에만 state 변경을 해준다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"array-object의-특징\" style=\"position:relative;\">array, object의 특징<a href=\"#array-object%EC%9D%98-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"array object의 특징 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>JavaScript에서 array와 object가 담겨있는 변수에는 해당 값이 저장되는것이 아니라,<br>\n해당값이 저장되어 있는 공간에 화살표만 저장된다.<br>\nstate변경 시, array나 object의 값만 변경하는게 아니라, 새로운 array나 object를 생성하여 변경 후 적용시켜줘야 한다.</p>\n<p>그래서 아래와 같이 작성하면 제대로 동작하지 않는다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setTitle<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'남자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'강남 우동맛집'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'리액트 독학'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  title<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'여자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">setTitle</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>글 수정<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 단순 복사의 경우 화살표만 복사되어 copy본과 원본이 동일하다.</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> copy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> title<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> \t\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 단순 복사 할 경우 화살표만 복사된다.</span>\r\ncopy<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'여자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span> copy <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> title <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// true가 나온다.</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// [...title] 로 Deep copy해야 한다.</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> copy2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">...</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\t\t<span class=\"token comment\">// 이렇게 복사해야 한다. (괄호를 벗긴 후 새로운 array를 만든다. 화살표가 달라짐)</span>\r\ncopy2<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'여자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span> copy2 <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> title <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// false</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"array-state-를-정렬-해보자\" style=\"position:relative;\">Array state 를 정렬 해보자!<a href=\"#array-state-%EB%A5%BC-%EC%A0%95%EB%A0%AC-%ED%95%B4%EB%B3%B4%EC%9E%90\" aria-label=\"array state 를 정렬 해보자 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setTitle<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'남자코트 추천'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'강남 우동맛집'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'파이썬 독학'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token operator\">=></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> \r\n      <span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> copy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">...</span>title<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      copy<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">sort</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function\">letTitle</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>copy<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>정렬하기<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%B3%B5%EC%82%AC-%EC%88%98%EC%A0%95-%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9\">복사, 수정, 적용</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#setstate%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%A0-%EA%B0%92-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%EC%9D%98-%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\">setState(변경할 값) 함수의 동작 특징</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#array-object%EC%9D%98-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\">array, object의 특징</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#array-state-%EB%A5%BC-%EC%A0%95%EB%A0%AC-%ED%95%B4%EB%B3%B4%EC%9E%90\">Array state 를 정렬 해보자!</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Sep 30, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"04. Array, Object State 변경하기","summary":"복사, 수정, 적용 array나 Object로 된 state를 변경할 때는 기존 state를 copy하여 수정 한 후 setState 해줘야 한다. setState(변경할 값) 함수의 동작 특징 기존 state와 변경될 state를 비교 후 다를때에만 state 변경을 해준다. array, object의 특징","date":"Nov 11, 2022","categories":["REACT"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/react/04_Array_Object_State_변경하기/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/react/03_useState/","title":"03. useState()"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/react/05_Component_생성_파일분리/","title":"05. Component 생성, 파일분리"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}